stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> accruing : enrollment in the statutory gratuity scheme at joining, GA1

    accruing --> accruing : GA2, a period closes, provision moves by the change in the accrued amount
    accruing --> accruing : GA3, a wage revision or a retro correction re-bases last drawn wages
    accruing --> vested : GA4, completed years reach gratuity_vesting_years
    vested --> vested : GA2 and GA3 continue after vesting

    accruing --> settlement_due : GA5, exit on death, disablement or fixed-term expiry, the vesting condition does not apply
    vested --> settlement_due : GA6, exit for any cause

    settlement_due --> computed : GA7, gratuity wage base and completed years resolved for the exit date
    computed --> operator_review : GA8, a continuity, transfer or reduction question the engine may not decide
    operator_review --> computed : GA9, the operator records the basis and a distinct checker approves

    computed --> approved : GA10, F and F run approved with the exempt and taxable split
    approved --> paid : GA11, settled through the F and F disbursal
    paid --> closed : GA12, the accrual row closes and the liability releases
    closed --> [*]

    accruing --> closed : GA13, exit with no entitlement, the provision releases in full
    vested --> closed : GA13

    note right of computed
        Exempt part is the lesser of the amount paid and the
        remaining lifetime exemption ceiling, per the carried reading.
        Further limbs of the exemption are not captured, B9.
        A missing prior exempt declaration is a blocking Task,
        never a silent zero.
    end note

    note left of accruing
        gratuity_payment_ceiling stays unset until a CoSS s.53 sub 3
        notification is located, B10. While unset the accrual is
        uncapped and every figure carries the flag.
    end note
